Log source:        cluster-health
Display name:      Cluster health events
Resource:          kafka (lkc- IDs; crn: organization/environment/cloud-cluster/kafka)
Scopes:            organization, environment, resource
Max lookback:      3d
Full-text search:  yes (--search-text over: message)

Search fields (--search field=value):
  id          string
  event_type  enum    SERVICE_MAINTENANCE, HEALTH_ALERT, CONFLUENT_STATUS_UPDATED, SERVICE_ISSUE_DETECTED
  level       enum    INFO, WARN, ERROR
  client_id   string

Returned fields (each log record):
  timestamp   timestamp  *  Event time, RFC 3339 UTC.
  level       enum       *  Severity level: INFO, WARN, ERROR.
  message     string     *  Human-readable description of the event.
  event_type  enum       *  Type of cluster health event.
  id          string        Unique identifier for this log record.
  crn         string        Confluent Resource Name of the resource the event concerns.
  source      string        Component or subsystem that generated the event.
  event_id    string        Event-specific identifier, when provided.
  status      string        Status associated with the event, when applicable.
  client_id   string        Kafka client ID, when the event names one.
  cluster_id  string        lkc- ID the event belongs to.

  * = default column in human output
